Dear WinDRBD users,

I just released WinDRBD 1.1.9. It contains many fixes for corner cases. Usually
you should not be affected by those, so there is no urgent need to upgrade
if you have a running WinDRBD instance. For details about the fixes (and also
fixes for the 1.1.8 release), please read the WHATSNEW.md file:

https://github.com/LINBIT/windrbd/blob/windrbd-1.1/WHATSNEW.md

LINBIT customers can access the installer with a signed driver via the
LINBIT repository. Please file a ticket (eMail: tickets@linbit.com) and
we will send you a link.

Best regards,

- Johannes



